{"id":"20d70a2e17839d0c","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range.md","title":"ZFC Seq Sequence Range","display":"df-zfc-seq-sequence-range — ZFC Seq Sequence Range","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-sequence-range — ZFC Seq Sequence Range","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-sequence-range — ZFC Seq Sequence Range"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" href=\"?note=9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,R\\in V\">\\(s,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceRange}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceRange}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}range}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceRange}_S(R,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(R,s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}range}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceRange}_S(R,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(R,s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Requiring an ordinal domain distinguishes a sequence from an arbitrary\nset-indexed family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a8f01bfcbcdc014","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceRange}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}range}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqSequenceRange}_S(R,s)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(R,s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1054,"backlinks":[{"id":"e3d4b6557d89a2b1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}$ (sequence domain/range, see [[58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-domain]], [[58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range]])"},{"id":"7cd9f34a9effddc2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range.md|58-df-zfc-seq-sequence-range]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9a8f01bfcbcdc014","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}